$b['Melting Time'] = 'Two panels side by side on one image, divided down the middle. LEFT PANEL: the tattoo design alone on a plain white background, shown flat exactly as described, no body, drawn large so it fills most of the panel. RIGHT PANEL: Studio photograph of a real person''s body showing the same exact tattoo where described, healed tattoo on real skin in soft even light, the rest of the body modestly covered by simple plain clothing, only the tattooed area bare, plain seamless light grey studio backdrop - no room, no furniture, no scenery. The tattoo in both panels is identical. The tattoo: Melting Time - a distorted face blending into a melting clock with flowing contours. A Surreal Mind-Bending Art tattoo: surrealist imagery, impossible geometry, melting objects, fragmented portraits, floating architecture, dreamlike landscapes, optical illusions, distorted anatomy, unexpected scale and visual paradoxes, in black and grey with selective muted color only where it strengthens the idea. No text, labels, logos or watermarks in the tattoo. In the right panel it is on a man, outer forearm, a medium tattoo about the size of his hand, with plenty of bare skin around it.'
